        "original_id": "65f7292c-41a8-577f-9114-c88770e0b4c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louisa Adams, Melania Trump, Donald Trump\n- Roles: First Lady, American Consul, President, fashion model\n- Places: London, United States, Thirteen Colonies\n\nFacts:\n- Louisa Adams was the daughter of the American Consul in London.\n- Louisa Adams was the first First Lady born outside the United States and outside areas that later became part of the United States, such as the Thirteen Colonies.\n- Melania Trump replicated Louisa Adams's distinction as a foreign-born First Lady 192 years later.\n- Before marrying future President Donald Trump in 2005, Melania Trump worked as a fashion model.\n- By 2016, Melania Trump considered herself a \"full-time mom.\"",
